{"id":"ddf53d1530db82ba","group":"58","path":"58/batch18/58-df-zfc-game3-strategy-profile.md","title":"ZFC Game3 Strategy Profile","display":"df-zfc-game3-strategy-profile — ZFC Game3 Strategy Profile","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-game3-strategy-profile","aliases":["58-df-zfc-game3-strategy-profile"],"display":"df-zfc-game3-strategy-profile — ZFC Game3 Strategy Profile","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-game3-strategy-profile"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-game3-strategy-profile</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-game3-strategy-profile — ZFC Game3 Strategy Profile"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H,I,P,\\sigma\\in V\">\\(H,I,P,\\sigma\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> (typed set-function predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H^\\circ\">\\(H^\\circ\\)</span> (nonterminal histories, defined below)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcGame3StrategyProfile}_S\\subseteq V^4\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcGame3StrategyProfile}_S\\subseteq V^4\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}game3\\text{-}nonterminal\\text{-}histories}\\vdash H^\\circ\\coloneqq\\{h\\in H:\\exists a\\in V\\;(h^\\frown\\langle a\\rangle\\in H)\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}game3\\text{-}nonterminal\\text{-}histories}\\vdash H^\\circ\\coloneqq\\{h\\in H:\\exists a\\in V\\;(h^\\frown\\langle a\\rangle\\in H)\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}game3\\text{-}strategy\\text{-}profile}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcGame3StrategyProfile}_S(H,I,P,\\sigma)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\nI\\neq\\varnothing\\land\\varnothing\\in H\n\\land\\forall h\\in H\\;\\exists n\\in\\omega\\;\\exists A\\in V\\;\n\\mathrm{Function}(h,n,A)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall h\\in H\\;\\forall n\\in\\operatorname{dom}(h)+1\\;\n\\bigl(h\\upharpoonright n\\in H\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\mathrm{Function}(P,H^\\circ,I)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\exists S\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Function}(\\sigma,I,S)\n\\land\\forall i\\in I\\;\\exists A_i\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Function}\\bigl(\\sigma(i),\\{h\\in H^\\circ:P(h)=i\\},A_i\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{42mm}{}\\land\\forall h\\in\\{u\\in H^\\circ:P(u)=i\\}\\;\n\\bigl(h^\\frown\\langle\\sigma(i)(h)\\rangle\\in H\\bigr)\\Bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}game3\\text{-}strategy\\text{-}profile}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcGame3StrategyProfile}_S(H,I,P,\\sigma)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\nI\\neq\\varnothing\\land\\varnothing\\in H\n\\land\\forall h\\in H\\;\\exists n\\in\\omega\\;\\exists A\\in V\\;\n\\mathrm{Function}(h,n,A)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall h\\in H\\;\\forall n\\in\\operatorname{dom}(h)+1\\;\n\\bigl(h\\upharpoonright n\\in H\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\mathrm{Function}(P,H^\\circ,I)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\exists S\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Function}(\\sigma,I,S)\n\\land\\forall i\\in I\\;\\exists A_i\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Function}\\bigl(\\sigma(i),\\{h\\in H^\\circ:P(h)=i\\},A_i\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{42mm}{}\\land\\forall h\\in\\{u\\in H^\\circ:P(u)=i\\}\\;\n\\bigl(h^\\frown\\langle\\sigma(i)(h)\\rangle\\in H\\bigr)\\Bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Histories and all strategy components are set functions with set codomains; no function is assigned the proper class <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V\">\\(V\\)</span> as codomain.</li>\n<li>Each component <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma(i)\">\\(\\sigma(i)\\)</span> has exactly the nonterminal histories where player <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\">\\(i\\)</span> moves as its domain, and every chosen action extends that history legally.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Function}\\s